+! Nontrivial DFT benchmark, not a converged materials prediction.
+! Geometry: a=4.674 A, buckling=0.852 A; doi:10.1038/srep18879.
+&GLOBAL
+  PROJECT stanene
+  RUN_TYPE ENERGY
+  PRINT_LEVEL LOW
+&END
+&FORCE_EVAL
